    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Age: with «avere»",
     "texto": [
      "Age is expressed with «avere» (to have): **Ho diciannove anni** (I'm nineteen).",
      "To ask: **Quanti anni hai?** (informal) or **Quanti anni ha?** (formal).",
      "The **h** in «ho, hai, ha, hanno» is not pronounced: it only serves to tell them apart from other words."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
